{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27626","headline":"酬答柳宗言秀才见赠 · 张祜","name":"酬答柳宗言秀才见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南下天台厌绝冥，五湖波上泛如萍。\n江鸥自戏爲踪迹，野鹿闲惊是性灵。\n任子偶垂沧海钓，戴逵虚认少微星。\n金门後俊徒相唁，且爲人间寄茯苓。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}